Step 1: create a config yaml file
apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
  name: app-config
data:
  APP_ENV: production
  APP_DEBUG: "false"
  LOG_LEVEL: info


step 2: apply the configmap with this command
kubectl apply -f "filename"
    And verfiy 
kubectl get configmaps

